{"id": "e12a0477d6524c99b890687baf1d1c87", "text": "It is the cro wn of knowledge. It is the pinnacle of secrets. It is \npurifying. It is superior. It is the means to learn about the Lord Almighty \nwho powers everyone\u2019s sense organs. It is easy to follow,  and it is the path \nfor eternal bliss. (9.2)  \n \nO Parantapa! Those who do not have faith in the knowledge that \nteaches about the Lord Almighty will not reach the Lord and will keep \nreturning to this mortal worldly life. (9.3)", "embedding": [0.04349598288536072, 0.05969866365194321, -0.024105152115225792, 0.03996032103896141, -0.04445803165435791, -0.025202618911862373, 0.054350800812244415, -0.0020007521379739046, 0.024333002045750618, 0.043853022158145905, 0.0016538378549739718, 0.023429283872246742, 0.016019349917769432, -0.03991195559501648, -0.11169098317623138, -0.0060880668461322784, -0.013709047809243202, -0.07311387360095978, -0.05219932645559311, -0.07398855686187744, 0.010860254056751728, 0.04564051330089569, -0.030322976410388947, 0.02207905426621437, -0.04419570043683052, 0.04749731346964836, -0.046644605696201324, -0.03662389516830444, 0.04041508957743645, -0.030523426830768585, -0.02043512463569641, 0.05707172676920891, 0.04595976322889328, -0.011124907992780209, -0.08830253779888153, 0.13578800857067108, 0.0800495445728302, 0.03276149928569794, 0.01304223295301199, -0.03724241629242897, -0.009278399869799614, 0.0067495969124138355, -0.01739538088440895, -0.020328979939222336, 0.029908204451203346, 0.031918711960315704, -0.04046458378434181, 0.004864776972681284, 0.042381126433610916, -0.04464200139045715, -0.10618825256824493, -0.08366737514734268, -0.019661996513605118, 0.07802360504865646, 0.0003115173021797091, 0.07714080810546875, -0.10598569363355637, -0.026100212708115578, -0.046254705637693405, -0.06889720261096954, -0.028546489775180817, -0.06721556186676025, 0.035264093428850174, 0.03800646588206291, 0.10601067543029785, -0.10217417776584625, 0.05690250173211098, -0.02687784